{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","externalID":"c:objc(cs)EXPPredictive(cm)checkIfEligibleForSurvey","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","modules":[{"name":"EXPPredictive"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.Verint.EXPPredictive\/documentation\/EXPPredictive","doc:\/\/com.Verint.EXPPredictive\/documentation\/EXPPredictive\/EXPPredictive"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.Verint.EXPPredictive\/documentation\/EXPPredictive\/EXPPredictive\/checkIfEligibleForSurvey"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In order to be eligible, a number of conditions must be fulfilled:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The library is in an enabled state. If the user has previously declined an invite","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or completed a survey, the library will be in a disabled state. Otherwise, the library is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in an enabled state."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The user has met the loyalty threshold defined in your exp_configuration.json file."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The user is in the sampling pool. If the previous two conditions have been met, the library"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"makes an HTTP call to our servers to determine if the user is in the sampling pool. If s\/he is,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the invite will be presented. If not, the invite will not be shown. Disable this remote check with"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"setSkipPoolingCheck:","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/exppredictive\/exppredictive\/checkifeligibleforsurvey"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Checks to see if the user is currently eligible to be invited to a survey."}],"references":{"doc://com.Verint.EXPPredictive/documentation/EXPPredictive/EXPPredictive/checkIfEligibleForSurvey":{"title":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Checks to see if the user is currently eligible to be invited to a survey.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.Verint.EXPPredictive\/documentation\/EXPPredictive\/EXPPredictive\/checkIfEligibleForSurvey","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/exppredictive\/exppredictive\/checkifeligibleforsurvey"},"doc://com.Verint.EXPPredictive/documentation/EXPPredictive/EXPPredictive":{"title":"EXPPredictive","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.Verint.EXPPredictive\/documentation\/EXPPredictive\/EXPPredictive","type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The EXPPredictive class provides the main interface to the Verint EXPPredictive module. You must add a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"exp_configuration.json","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" file to your project that defines the behavior of the Trigger module (e.g. defines the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"triggering criteria for inviting a user to participate in a survey).","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/exppredictive\/exppredictive","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"EXPPredictive","kind":"identifier"}]},"setSkipPoolingCheck:":{"title":"setSkipPoolingCheck:","url":"setSkipPoolingCheck:","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"setSkipPoolingCheck:","type":"text"}],"type":"link","identifier":"setSkipPoolingCheck:"},"doc://com.Verint.EXPPredictive/documentation/EXPPredictive":{"type":"topic","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/exppredictive","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.Verint.EXPPredictive\/documentation\/EXPPredictive","title":"EXPPredictive"}}}